        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref>&lt; dim &gt; *</type>
          <defname>eptr</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>projection of a vector field in 1D is simply the original fields</para>
<para>projection of a vector field onto a unit norm vector r(r[0],r[1]),|r|=1 VecProj = ( vec, r ) r</para>
<para>( VecProj, vec ) &gt; 0 Note that the direction of the result vector should be align with the original one</para>
<para>projection of a vector field onto a unit norm vector r(r[0],r[1],r[2]),|r|=1 VecProj = ( vec, r ) r</para>
<para>(n,vec) &gt;0 Note that the direction of the result vector should be align with the original one</para>
<para>projection of a vector field onto a surface with a unit normal vector n(n[0], n[1], n[2]), |n|=1 VecProj = n x ( n x vec ) = ( vec, n ) n - vec</para>
<para>( VecProj, vec ) &gt; 0 Note that the direction of the result vector should be align with the original one</para>
        </inbodydescription>
